<title>UK: Capital Shopping raises stake in UK Prime.</title>
<headline>Capital Shopping raises stake in UK Prime.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Shopping Centres Plc said on Monday that it had purchased a further interest in UK Prime Property Partnerships for 13.93 million stg.</p>
<p>This acquisition, made from Pensions Funds LP, would take CSC's total investment in UK Prime to 42.4 million stg.</p>
<p>CSC's stake in Prime rise to 22.5 percent from 15.5 percent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
